                    <div class="comp-footnotes__content"><p>See Anthony P. Carnevale, , Stephen J. Rose, and Ban Cheah, "<a href="http://cew.georgetown.edu/collegepayoff">The College Payoff: Education, Occupations, Lifetime Earnings</a>," Georgetown University Center on Education and the Workforce, August 5, 2011.</p></div>
